    {
      "id": 479014,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-26T13:04:33.587Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tdon\">@tdon</a></p>\n<p>If you want one Universal incoming email account to be accessible for multiple users so that they can read and respond to the incoming email timely, you have to incorporate that email account within each user profile as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b_2_690x393.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mNYIIZTBOCmajp0nXWZSftxOvPB\" width=\"690\" height=\"393\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b_2_690x393.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b_2_1035x589.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fd6251fcf44ce664b37278b74f61e2eeaa9429b_2_1380x786.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1568×895 68.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and then communication doctype will react as INBOX for all those at the same time.</p>\n<p>This has nothing to do with user permissions and role profiling.</p>",
